WEBVTT

1
00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:05.083
In the previous few verses

2
00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:06.416
of the seventh chapter,

3
00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:09.500
Lord Krishna explained three main things –

4
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.500
First,

5
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.958
about those four categories of people

6
00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:15.375
who don't worship Him,

7
00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.375
Then about those four

8
00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.166
categories of people

9
00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:20.958
who move toward Krishna worship,

10
00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:21.625
and then

11
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:24.791
He also explained about a jñānī.

12
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:27.000
Now a natural question

13
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.125
can arise in the mind –

14
00:01:28.125 --> 00:01:29.666
there are also such people

15
00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:32.375
who don't fall in any of these categories –

16
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:35.000
who haven't turned their face
 away from Krishna,

17
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.125
don't completely disbelieve,

18
00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:40.000
but also don't worship Him.

19
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.083
So what about such people?

20
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:43.916
The answer to this is in the twentieth,

21
00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:47.666
twenty-first, and twenty-second
 verses of the seventh chapter.

22
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.625
First,

23
00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:54.750
in the twentieth verse

24
00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.833
of the seventh chapter, Lord Krishna explains

25
00:01:57.833 --> 00:01:59.708
that material desires and selfishness

26
00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:01.791
mislead humans,

27
00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:04.041
and in such a case, instead of spirituality

28
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:06.166
and meeting the Supreme Soul,

29
00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:09.541
humans start focusing their 
attention on desire fulfillment.

30
00:02:09.541 --> 00:02:11.500
And such humans many times

31
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.833
go to the shelter of other gods and goddesses,

32
00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.500
and according to their nature,

33
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.583
for desire fulfillment

34
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:18.166
perform many procedures

35
00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:20.458
and religious rituals.

36
00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:23.958
Here again, the meaning of human's nature

37
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:27.458
is the three guṇas of sattva, rajas, and tamas.

38
00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:29.166
And according to this very nature,

39
00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:30.625
some people, instead of leaning

40
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:32.250
toward Lord Krishna for spirituality and moksha,

41
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.666
are attracted toward

42
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:36.416
other gods and goddesses

43
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:39.208
and worship them to quickly obtain happiness

44
00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:41.083
and prosperity.

45
00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:42.625
But Krishna had also said

46
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:45.833
in previous verses that some arthārthī

47
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:46.875
also come to His shelter

48
00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:49.791
for wealth or property, etc.,

49
00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:51.666
So Krishna is clarifying here

50
00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:54.666
that going toward other gods
 and goddesses and

51
00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:56.041
coming directly to Krishna –

52
00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:58.375
these are two different things.

53
00:02:58.375 --> 00:02:59.833
How these are different

54
00:02:59.833 --> 00:03:02.833
will be revealed in the next two verses.

55
00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:04.458
In the twenty-first verse

56
00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:06.750
of the seventh chapter, Lord Krishna now says

57
00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:09.791
that the person who worships some
 specific god or goddess

58
00:03:09.791 --> 00:03:11.541
with devotion,

59
00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:14.041
where does this devotion come from?

60
00:03:14.041 --> 00:03:17.000
The source of their this devotion is also Me,

61
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.333
I am the one situated as
 Supreme Soul in their heart

62
00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.750
and I help them in strengthening

63
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.083
their this devotion.

64
00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.041
This is Krishna's compassion and glory – that

65
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.666
even those who don't come to His shelter,

66
00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:32.000
He uplifts them too.

67
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.291
He supports even the faith

68
00:03:33.291 --> 00:03:37.208
that arises in humans for
 other gods and goddesses.

69
00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:39.750
Because for spiritual upliftment,

70
00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.916
devotion is extremely important,

71
00:03:41.916 --> 00:03:43.750
and if humans show devotion

72
00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.250
even toward other gods and goddesses,

73
00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.250
then Krishna knows that this devotion will later be

74
00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.083
helpful in taking that human on the

75
00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:54.291
right path of spirituality.

76
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:56.333
Lord Krishna's purpose is only

77
00:03:56.333 --> 00:03:57.958
human's upliftment,

78
00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:01.666
not just that His own glory be sung. But

79
00:04:01.666 --> 00:04:04.583
still, direct surrender to Krishna

80
00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:07.208
and surrender to other gods and goddesses –

81
00:04:07.208 --> 00:04:10.666
there's definitely a difference in this.
 And the main difference

82
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:14.000
becomes clear in the verses coming ahead.

83
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.375
Krishna says in the twenty-second verse

84
00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:18.083
that the person filled with devotion toward

85
00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:21.291
other gods and goddesses, when they worship

86
00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:24.291
and as a result obtain the fruit of their desire,

87
00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:25.708
then actually that fruit

88
00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:28.583
is being received from Lord Krishna's grace only.

89
00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:30.375
An important thing had also come

90
00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:34.375
in previous chapters, where we had learned

91
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:37.416
that Krishna, who is the master of this world,

92
00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:40.583
runs this world's smooth functioning

93
00:04:40.583 --> 00:04:43.666
through many gods and goddesses.

94
00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:46.250
These gods and goddesses
 are that very medium

95
00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.208
through which Krishna's grace

96
00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:51.208
reaches the devotees of these deities.

97
00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:54.083
This entire world, all gods and goddesses

98
00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:56.000
function on the basis

99
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.500
of Lord Krishna's powers

100
00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.958
and are surrendered to Him,
 and therefore, Lord Krishna

101
00:05:00.958 --> 00:05:02.458
inspires devotion toward

102
00:05:02.458 --> 00:05:04.583
other gods and goddesses.

103
00:05:04.583 --> 00:05:05.666
But yes,

104
00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:08.666
here the main difference also becomes clear.

105
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:11.291
Worship of Lord Krishna is like

106
00:05:11.291 --> 00:05:14.333
directly making contact with the main source.

107
00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:15.708
Liberation from this material world

108
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:18.875
will be possible only through
 worship of Lord Krishna.

109
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:22.125
These three verses tell us how people

110
00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:24.041
worship other gods and goddesses

111
00:05:24.041 --> 00:05:26.666
for their material desires.

112
00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:27.833
But ultimately,

113
00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:29.083
the fruit of this human worship

114
00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:31.333
can be given by other gods and goddesses

115
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:32.500
only because

116
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.291
of Lord Krishna's glory.

117
00:05:35.291 --> 00:05:38.041
This shows Lord Krishna's compassion

118
00:05:38.041 --> 00:05:40.666
that He accepts every devotee.

119
00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:42.291
He just wants

120
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:45.166
that the seed of devotion awakens in humans.

121
00:05:45.166 --> 00:05:47.708
Because later, this very devotion

122
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:50.750
will also inspire humans toward Lord Krishna.

123
00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:54.208
And we must understand
 that ultimately, moksha

124
00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:57.791
will be obtained only through
 worship of Lord Krishna.

125
00:05:57.791 --> 00:06:01.083
This spiritual upliftment is what Lord Krishna

126
00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:03.666
wants for every devotee.

127
00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:09.416
Some people

128
00:06:09.416 --> 00:06:13.416
for fulfillment of their material desires

129
00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:17.250
worship other gods and goddesses.

130
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.750
Their desires also get fulfilled

131
00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.166
immediately from this.

132
00:06:22.166 --> 00:06:27.583
But this strong desire to obtain
 something immediately

133
00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:30.291
isn't limited only to devotion.

134
00:06:30.291 --> 00:06:34.041
In life too, many people for success, wealth,

135
00:06:34.041 --> 00:06:35.541
and honor,

136
00:06:35.541 --> 00:06:39.333
remain engaged in finding such means where

137
00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:44.125
they get everything immediately without effort.

138
00:06:44.125 --> 00:06:47.666
They also find such means,

139
00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:50.791
they also get success to some level.

140
00:06:50.791 --> 00:06:51.750
But

141
00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:55.375
all this remains pleasant only at the beginning,

142
00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:59.666
and this happiness can't last long.

143
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:02.708
This happens because

144
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:06.625
true joy arises from within,

145
00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:09.333
and if through some simple path

146
00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:12.625
you immediately obtained success,

147
00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:15.750
then external thing was definitely obtained,

148
00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.958
but nothing changed within.

149
00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:22.791
And if change didn't come within,

150
00:07:22.791 --> 00:07:26.750
then joy also won't last.

151
00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:32.333
The joy of success without effort
 is like catching a reflection –

152
00:07:32.333 --> 00:07:35.041
it seems it came in hand,

153
00:07:35.041 --> 00:07:36.750
but the very next moment

154
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.166
that reflection slips away.

155
00:07:39.166 --> 00:07:40.708
For example,

156
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:43.750
someone obtained something through deceit,

157
00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:44.833
or achieved success

158
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:48.750
by copying someone else.

159
00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:52.333
So will its satisfaction last? No.

160
00:07:52.333 --> 00:07:54.291
The world will see external success,

161
00:07:54.291 --> 00:07:56.666
will appreciate this too,

162
00:07:56.666 --> 00:08:00.875
but only you know your inner self, right?

163
00:08:00.875 --> 00:08:04.125
The more worldly fame increases,

164
00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:08.500
the more guilt will also increase
 that what you obtained

165
00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.250
didn't have your effort.

166
00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:16.250
Ultimately, deep dissatisfaction
 will settle in the mind,

167
00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:20.666
and all joy will disappear.

168
00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:22.000
For permanent success

169
00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.583
and the joy connected to it,

170
00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:28.708
dedication and true effort are necessary.

171
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:31.250
Only from this, along with external gain,

172
00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.916
internal transformation will also happen,

173
00:08:33.916 --> 00:08:36.791
and joy's sweet essence

174
00:08:36.791 --> 00:08:39.583
can be tasted from within.

175
00:08:39.583 --> 00:08:42.208
Keep dedication

176
00:08:42.208 --> 00:08:43.791
and effort in your actions,

177
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:47.041
and keep doing self-examination continuously –

178
00:08:47.041 --> 00:08:51.208
are you only making external progress,

179
00:08:51.208 --> 00:08:53.791
or internal too?

180
00:08:53.791 --> 00:08:57.208
The world will see only the surface,

181
00:08:57.208 --> 00:08:58.500
but the mind's joy

182
00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.041
will come from looking within.

183
00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:03.083
What's the benefit of that fruit

184
00:09:03.083 --> 00:09:06.541
which looks sweet to everyone
 but leaves bitterness

185
00:09:06.541 --> 00:09:10.708
in your mouth upon tasting?

186
00:09:10.708 --> 00:09:14.125
I hope you'll consider this,

187
00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:16.375
and follow it too.

188
00:09:20.916 --> 00:09:26.208
Today, when everything is spreading
 fast through communication media,

189
00:09:26.208 --> 00:09:29.250
external glitter of success

190
00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.250
has started being considered everything.

191
00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.166
In society, who's how famous,

192
00:09:35.166 --> 00:09:39.333
how many followers someone
 has, this number has now

193
00:09:39.333 --> 00:09:43.458
started becoming the basis
 of someone's evaluation.

194
00:09:43.458 --> 00:09:47.916
Especially the younger generation,
 without examining,

195
00:09:47.916 --> 00:09:50.291
has started following famous people

196
00:09:50.291 --> 00:09:53.458
like some god,

197
00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:56.000
wants to become like them.

198
00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.000
Everyone wants to become famous

199
00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.083
as quickly as possible,

200
00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:04.125
has started looking for the simplest path for this.

201
00:10:04.125 --> 00:10:06.750
You definitely follow famous people,

202
00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.458
you definitely obtain entertainment from them,

203
00:10:09.458 --> 00:10:11.958
if something good is to be learned from them,

204
00:10:11.958 --> 00:10:13.583
then learn.

205
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:18.250
My purpose is certainly not to
 control your this choice.

206
00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.000
Rather, I want that

207
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.416
you obtain everything

208
00:10:22.416 --> 00:10:24.958
that's supreme for you.

209
00:10:24.958 --> 00:10:27.250
But do remember this thing –

210
00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.458
the famous people whom you

211
00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:33.541
follow for your entertainment or guidance

212
00:10:33.541 --> 00:10:38.541
will be able to give you only
 momentary joy or guidance.

213
00:10:38.541 --> 00:10:41.291
What's important isn't who's

214
00:10:41.291 --> 00:10:43.291
how famous,

215
00:10:43.291 --> 00:10:46.333
what's important is who's how satisfied

216
00:10:46.333 --> 00:10:51.750
in that fame, stress-free.

217
00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.750
And you cannot know

218
00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.333
their this internal state.

219
00:10:57.333 --> 00:11:01.375
Therefore, the path that's suitable for you,

220
00:11:01.375 --> 00:11:04.291
you'll have to find yourself.

221
00:11:04.291 --> 00:11:08.750
Such a path where along
 with success and fame,

222
00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.666
there's also internal peace. And internal peace

223
00:11:12.666 --> 00:11:16.583
won't be obtained only from external glitter.

224
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:21.208
For that, along with external success,

225
00:11:21.208 --> 00:11:24.208
you'll also have to look within yourself,

226
00:11:24.208 --> 00:11:27.416
will have to take support of spirituality.

227
00:11:27.416 --> 00:11:30.458
Whatever choice you make in life,

228
00:11:30.458 --> 00:11:33.250
whomever you follow,

229
00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.625
you're free for all these.

230
00:11:36.625 --> 00:11:38.625
But along with this,

231
00:11:38.625 --> 00:11:43.875
don't ignore your soul's satisfaction.

232
00:11:43.875 --> 00:11:48.208
When you take support
 of spirituality, when you

233
00:11:48.208 --> 00:11:53.500
come toward Me, then your life's path

234
00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.208
will start appearing clear.

235
00:12:00.833 --> 00:12:01.666
Many people

236
00:12:01.666 --> 00:12:03.541
just want

237
00:12:03.541 --> 00:12:06.500
that their desire be fulfilled quickly,

238
00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.666
and for this very selfishness,

239
00:12:08.666 --> 00:12:12.083
worship other gods/goddesses.

240
00:12:12.083 --> 00:12:14.916
In professional life too, many times people

241
00:12:14.916 --> 00:12:18.291
run after success obtained quickly –

242
00:12:18.291 --> 00:12:18.916
for this,

243
00:12:18.916 --> 00:12:22.375
instead of effort, they apply tricks,

244
00:12:22.375 --> 00:12:24.000
start worshipping some senior officer

245
00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.458
like God,

246
00:12:26.458 --> 00:12:28.291
engage in pleasing them

247
00:12:28.291 --> 00:12:31.666
through false praise.

248
00:12:31.666 --> 00:12:35.333
The honor, promotion,

249
00:12:35.333 --> 00:12:36.333
or small achievements

250
00:12:36.333 --> 00:12:37.791
obtained this way

251
00:12:37.791 --> 00:12:39.875
also seem exciting at the beginning.

252
00:12:39.875 --> 00:12:43.166
But this is the irony –

253
00:12:43.166 --> 00:12:48.000
whether worship of gods and
 goddesses for selfishness,

254
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.208
or false praise of senior officers

255
00:12:51.208 --> 00:12:53.208
in professional life,

256
00:12:53.208 --> 00:12:55.708
the results obtained from both these

257
00:12:55.708 --> 00:12:59.125
can give happiness for some time

258
00:12:59.125 --> 00:13:04.250
but permanent development and internal peace

259
00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.291
can never be obtained in this.

260
00:13:06.291 --> 00:13:07.375
When your

261
00:13:07.375 --> 00:13:12.291
attention is engaged in
 obtaining gain as quickly as possible,

262
00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:17.000
then you forget a broad perspective –

263
00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.916
that perspective which will take
 to permanent success

264
00:13:19.916 --> 00:13:23.750
and life's real destination.

265
00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.041
Just as spiritual progress

266
00:13:25.041 --> 00:13:28.750
is necessary for satisfaction in life,

267
00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:33.291
similarly for permanent professional success,

268
00:13:33.291 --> 00:13:36.666
patience and dedication are necessary.

269
00:13:36.666 --> 00:13:38.208
And if seen,

270
00:13:38.208 --> 00:13:41.875
all this is connected with each other –

271
00:13:41.875 --> 00:13:46.541
spiritual progress will happen from patience and dedication,

272
00:13:46.541 --> 00:13:49.166
and patience and dedication
 will automatically awaken

273
00:13:49.166 --> 00:13:53.791
from spiritual advancement.

274
00:13:53.791 --> 00:13:57.208
So know this – spirituality,

275
00:13:57.208 --> 00:14:00.000
patience, dedication toward action,

276
00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:05.458
these three are the foundation
 of never-wavering success.

277
00:14:05.458 --> 00:14:06.916
On this foundation,

278
00:14:06.916 --> 00:14:09.833
material success will definitely last,

279
00:14:09.833 --> 00:14:13.000
the soul's joy will also last.

280
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.958
